<li>&lt;a href="http%3A//news.bbc.co.uk/2/hi/asia-pacific/6745433.stm"&gt;'Father of Sudoku' puzzles next move&lt;/a&gt; (&lt;a href="BBC"&gt;BBC&lt;/a&gt;)</li>
</ul>

