<doc id="32759" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=32759" title="Asem jawa">
Asem jawa

Asem jawa iku sajinis &lt;a href="woh"&gt;woh&lt;/a&gt; kang rasané &lt;a href="kecut"&gt;kecut&lt;/a&gt;; biyasa kanggo bumbu masak, contoné masakan &lt;a href="jangan%20asem"&gt;jangan asem&lt;/a&gt;.
Asem jawa dikasilaké saka &lt;a href="wit"&gt;wit&lt;/a&gt; kang jeneng ngèlmiahé Tamarindus indica, kalebu &lt;a href="familia"&gt;suku&lt;/a&gt; Fabaceae (Leguminosae). &lt;a href="Spesies"&gt;Spesies&lt;/a&gt; iki minangka siji-sijiné anggota &lt;a href="g%C3%A9nus"&gt;marga&lt;/a&gt; Tamarindus. Jeneng liya asem jawa yakuwi asem (&lt;a href="basa%20Melayu"&gt;basa Melayu&lt;/a&gt;), asem (&lt;a href="basa%20Indon%C3%A9sia"&gt;basa Indonésia&lt;/a&gt;), sampalok (&lt;a href="Filipina"&gt;Tagalog&lt;/a&gt;), ma-kham (&lt;a href="Thailand"&gt;Thai&lt;/a&gt;), lan tamarind (&lt;a href="basa%20Inggris"&gt;Ingg.&lt;/a&gt;). Woh kang wis tuwa lan mateng banget diarani asem kawak.
