<doc id="33017" url="https://jv.wikipedia.org/wiki?curid=33017" title="Krasnodar">
Krasnodar

Krasnodar (&lt;a href="Basa%20Rusia"&gt;Rusia&lt;/a&gt;: Краснода́р) iku sawijining &lt;a href="kutha"&gt;kutha&lt;/a&gt; ing &lt;a href="Ruslan"&gt;Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; kidul ing iliné &lt;a href="Kali%20Kuban"&gt;Kali Kuban&lt;/a&gt;. Kutha iki ya iku punjering administrasi &lt;a href="Krasnodar%20Krai"&gt;Krasnodar Krai&lt;/a&gt; (uga misuwur minangka &lt;a href="Kuban"&gt;Kuban&lt;/a&gt;). Ambané pawarihan: 339,31 km2. Cacah jiwa: 1.154.885 wong.
<h2>Jeneng</h2>
Jeneng.
Diadegaké ing &lt;a href="12%20Januari"&gt;12 Januari&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="1794"&gt;1794&lt;/a&gt; (Kalender Grégorius) minangka Yekaterinodar (Екатеринода́р). Jeneng asli iku tegesé "Catherine's Gift" utawa bebungah Katerin, kanggo ngurmati pawèwèh saka &lt;a href="Catherine%20II%20saka%20Ruslan"&gt;Catherine Agung&lt;/a&gt; wujud lemah ing tlatah Kuban marang &lt;a href="Black%20Sea%20Cossack%20Host"&gt;Black Sea Cossacks&lt;/a&gt; (sabanjuré dadi &lt;a href="Kuban%20Cossacks"&gt;Kuban Cossacks&lt;/a&gt;) lan kanggo mèngeti &lt;a href="Saint%20Catherine%20saka%20Alexandria"&gt;Saint Catherine&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Martyr"&gt;Martyr&lt;/a&gt; utawa pahlawan sing dianggep dadi panutan kutha iki. Sawisé &lt;a href="Revolusi%20Ruslan"&gt;Revolusi Ruslan&lt;/a&gt; taun 1917 utawa &lt;a href="Revolusi%20Oktober"&gt;Revolusi Oktober&lt;/a&gt;. Yekaterinodar dialih jeneng dadi Krasnodar (Dhésèmber, 1920). Ana makna loro tumrap jeneng anyar kutha iki, yakuwi: Krasno-(Красно-), tegesé éndah utawa abang; lan-dar (-дар), tegesé 'pawèwèh'. Mula makna jeneng kutha iki yakuwi pawèwèh kang éndah utawa pawèwèh sing abang.
<h2>Kutha kembar</h2>
Kutha kembar.
Krasnodar duwé papat &lt;a href="kutha%20kembar"&gt;kutha kembar&lt;/a&gt;, miturut &lt;a href="http%3A//www.sister-cities.org/icrc/directory/NIS/Russia"&gt;Sister Cities International, Inc. (SCI)&lt;/a&gt;:
<ul>
<li>#ALIH &lt;a href="Tallahassee%2C%20Florida"&gt;Tallahassee, Florida&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Am%C3%A9rikah%20Sar%C3%A9kat"&gt;Amérikah Sarékat&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>#Alih &lt;a href="Karlsruhe"&gt;Karlsruhe&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Jerman"&gt;Jerman&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>#ALIH &lt;a href="Burgas"&gt;Burgas&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Bulgaria"&gt;Bulgaria&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>#ALIH &lt;a href="Harbin"&gt;Harbin&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="China"&gt;China&lt;/a&gt;</li>
<li>#ALIH &lt;a href="Ferrara"&gt;Ferrara&lt;/a&gt;, &lt;a href="Italia"&gt;Italia&lt;/a&gt;</li>
</ul>
